   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Soulive**: rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2000-03-23.flac1644** (recommended): source not stated; 4 songs; 51 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Microphones were placed in the sixth row center, about ten feet high, in the d.f.c. position [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2000-03-23.flac1644**: taped by Brandon Smith; transferred by Patrick Price; source: AKG C-1000 (hyper) > Tascam DA-P1 (48.0) (6th row center DFC about 10' high) [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG C-1000 microphones in hypercardioid pattern, going into a Tascam DA-P1 DAT recorder at 48 kHz; Transfer chain: Tascam DA-20 MKII to Tascam HD-P2, then Sony Soundforge 8.0 at 44.1 kHz, CD Wave, and FLAC [1]",
